# IsoRim pets in the blob style (Husky, Labrador retriever, Yorkshire terrier, Cat). Generated by tools/make_pets1_concept.py.
# Kd = the vanilla sprite's lit white. Labrador (220,198,160), Cat (189,171,159) and the untinted Yorkie take their colour
# from the game (ModelDef tintFromGraphic, Api 49). Husky: vanilla tints only its mask area (CutoutComplex), so its grey
# saddle is baked into the texture and it is bound without tintFromGraphic.
newmtl an_husky_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Husky

newmtl an_labrador_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Labrador

newmtl an_yorkie_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/YorkshireTerrier

newmtl an_cat_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/Cat
